      "parent": "C08",
      "ja": "天然高分子化合物の誘導体（多糖類Ｃ０８Ｂ；天然ゴムＣ０８Ｃ；天然樹脂またはその誘導体Ｃ０９Ｆ；ピッチ，アスファルト，ビチューメンの処理Ｃ１０Ｃ３／００）<br><br><b><ul>注</ul></b><br>化合物の治療活性は，サブクラスＡ６１Ｐにさらに分類する。［７］",
      "en": "DERIVATIVES OF NATURAL MACROMOLECULAR COMPOUNDS(polysaccharides <b>C08B</b>; natural rubber <b>C08C</b>; natural resins or their derivatives <b>C09F</b>; working up pitch, asphalt or bitumen <b>C10C3/00</b>);<br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul><li>Therapeutic activity of compounds is further classified in subclass <b>A61P</b>.</li></ul>",
