    "C07D519/00": {
      "code": "C07D519/00",
      "level": 0,
      "parent": "C07D",
      "ja": "相互に，または共有している炭素環系を介して縮合した２個以上の関連する複素環からなる２個以上の系を含有し，Ｃ０７Ｄ４５３／００～Ｃ０７Ｄ４５５／００に属さない複素環式化合物［２］",
      "en": "Heterocyclic compounds containing more than one system of two or more relevant hetero rings condensed among themselves or condensed with a common carbocyclic ring system not provided for in groups <b>C07D453/00</b> or <b>C07D455/00</b>",
      "count": 14624,
      "sourceFile": "ipc_C07D.txt",
      "kind": "ipc"
    },
    "C07D519/02": {
      "code": "C07D519/02",
      "level": 1,
      "parent": "C07D519/00",
      "ja": "環状ペプチド型の麦角アルカロイド［２］",
      "en": "Ergot alkaloids of the cyclic peptide type",
      "count": 315,
      "sourceFile": "ipc_C07D.txt",
      "kind": "ipc"
    },
    "C07D519/04": {
      "code": "C07D519/04",
      "level": 1,
      "parent": "C07D519/00",
      "ja": "二量体インドールアルカロイド，例．ビンカロイコブラスチン",
      "en": "Dimeric indole alkaloids, e.g. vincaleucoblastine",
      "count": 543,
      "sourceFile": "ipc_C07D.txt",
      "kind": "ipc"
    },
    "C07D519/06": {
      "code": "C07D519/06",
      "level": 1,
      "parent": "C07D519/00",
      "ja": "すくなくとも１個の縮合ベータラクタム環系を含有するもので，グループＣ０７Ｄ４６３／００，４７７／００，４９９／００～５０７／００に分類されるもの，例．１個のペネムまたはセファム系［６］",
      "en": "containing at least one condensed beta-lactam ring system, provided for by groups <b>C07D463/00</b>, <b>C07D477/00</b> or <b>C07D499/00 to C07D507/00</b> , e.g. a penem or a cepham system",
      "count": 537,
      "sourceFile": "ipc_C07D.txt",
      "kind": "ipc"
    },
    "C07D521/00": {
      "code": "C07D521/00",
      "level": 0,
      "parent": "C07D",
      "ja": "不特定の複素環を含有する複素環式化合物［２］<br><br><b><ul>注</ul></b><br>このサブクラスは特定されない化学構造の複素環式化合物のみに用いる。すなわち、グループ２０１／００～５１９／００のいずれにも属さない複素環式化合物に適用する。",
      "en": "Heterocyclic compounds containing unspecified hetero rings; <br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul><li>This group is only used for the classification of heterocyclic compounds the chemical structure of which are not specified, i.e. only in those cases where the heterocyclic compounds cannot be classified in any of groups <b>C07D201/00 to C07D519/00</b> .</li></ul>",
      "count": 6600,
      "sourceFile": "ipc_C07D.txt",
      "kind": "ipc"
    },
