      "en": "Refining of hydrocarbon oils using hydrogen or hydrogen-generating compounds; <br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul><li>Treatment of hydrocarbon oils in the presence of hydrogen-generating compounds not provided for in a single one of groups <b>C10G45/02</b>, <b>C10G45/32</b>, <b>C10G45/44</b>, or <b>C10G45/58</b> is covered by group <b>C10G49/00</b>. </li></ul>",
