      "en": "Cyclic or bridged peptides or polypeptides, e.g. bacitracin; <br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul><li>Cyclic or bridged peptides or polypeptides cyclised only by &mdash;S&mdash;S&mdash; bonds are classified in group <b>C12P21/02</b> only.</li></ul>",
